contract Lending
parties owner

物件 Item
  name 文字
  持有人 owner

can lend by owner to 相對方
  正常 -> lent
  持有人 = 相對方
can bring_back by 持有人
  lent -> 正常
  持有人 = owner

test "lent to a friend, brought back, lent to another"
  owner 建立 with name = "Camera X100"
  owner lend to friend1 -> lent
  friend1 bring_back -> 正常
  owner lend to friend2 -> lent

test "the borrower agrees to have it"
  owner 建立 with name = "Camera X100"
  owner lend to friend1 -> 經 friend1 同意

test "nothing is lent twice, and only the holder brings it back"
  owner 建立 with name = "Camera X100"
  owner lend to friend1 -> lent
  owner lend to friend2 -> 被拒絕 "bo:state lend"
  friend2 bring_back -> 經 friend1 同意
  friend1 bring_back 時間 2027-01-05 -> 正常
